  - displayName: LOCK & KEY
    mechanic: 2
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f2bbaf32ae584d938a8006b7938fa43f, type: 3}
    description: A locked car can't move. Send out the car with the matching key
      to unlock it.
  - displayName: MYSTERY PASSENGERS
    mechanic: 3
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: eecbff316b3b82547a605f2c751e6c2c, type: 3}
    description: Some passengers hide their color. It shows when they get near the
      front of the line.
  - displayName: CONSTRUCTION
    mechanic: 4
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 26dc690a35134e01a15581c357fb3246, type: 3}
    description: This slot is closed. Fill buses with passengers to open it.
